Sidebar and tooltip names come from the string tables, never the codename.

The cameo tooltip printed the rules id when UIName was empty and "Name:<id>" when the
label was missing; only ra2.csf (language.mix) was read, so every Yuri unit and
structure (ra2md.csf in langmd.mix) lost its name. ra2engine::StringTables layers
ra2md.csf over ra2.csf (loose file before the mix copy, file names case-insensitive);
display_name() = UIName -> "Name:<id>" -> rules Name= -> readable_name(id).
Superweapon cameos get a tooltip too; the superweapon timer label uses the same names.

